WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.305
Build your intuition for AND, OR, NOT and XOR with live switches.

00:00:05.305 --> 00:00:06.663
Use an AND gate.

00:00:06.663 --> 00:00:10.060
Let A mean cover closed and B mean start pressed.

00:00:10.060 --> 00:00:11.758
Output = A AND B.

00:00:11.758 --> 00:00:14.135
Only A=1 and B=1 starts the machine.

00:00:15.135 --> 00:00:18.130
Which gate outputs 1 when its two inputs differ?

00:00:18.130 --> 00:00:22.455
XOR is true for 01 and 10, and false for 00 and 11.
